/**
 * THE DIAL TABLE — the machine-readable registry of every LIVE model parameter
 * (the adopted design record + the live-cap amendment).
 *
 * One row per live key (simulation-path / dormant-scenario / consumed per-year); dead,
 * display-only, and retired keys are structurally absent — a manifest referencing them
 * cannot validate. Generated from the an earlier design session census (v2) + the mounted-UI control
 * sweep + the R2 cap sweep (the maintainer's working records); maintained as source from
 * here (the coverage gate in r2-manifest-tests.test.ts asserts it stays current).
 *
 * liveCap: a MEASURED computation clamp that binds this config value (value <= cap —
 * the validator rule; the mechanized Part-A lesson). Populated by measurement only;
 * null = the sweep found none (never estimated).
 * explanation: USER_PARAMETERS layer-1 plain-English text. Rows without one carry '' —
 * authored at R3b when the power screen renders them (no auto-generated prose; the
 * accuracy guard). Coverage is reported per stage.
 * trajectoryEvolved: design decision-2 class — an axis variant sets this key's BASELINE and the
 * autopilot evolves from it (baselineOrigin sub-tag carries the provenance).
 */

